        {
            "id": "4caf92a0-3cbf-4627-ac61-4e86796a291e",
            "build_id": "5e46a806-add9-4227-8661-e5493d2b5330",
            "round_number": 1,
            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-10-01T00:54:39.104481+00:00",
            "notes": "Starting the game you have 2 options :\n- You can perma flank targeting the DPS and Supports. This works best against characters like [Soldier: 76](hero_e1ac7ef5-4648-4998-b8b0-9e3da3e60546), [Zenyatta](hero_3c4002ee-e694-48ed-9730-70fd48773317), [Moira](hero_7fb6ff1e-a193-40c0-bd0a-25c1928fbaed)After she [Fade](ability_438ee61f-f7ed-4321-9ca3-d3577b89ba19)'s, and [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f) after [Protection Suzu](ability_e0d6579f-d70a-4a5e-a58d-aee40d00c568). In this case I would always go for [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) but if you think you will be dying a lot your can go for [Winning Attitude](item_8714087c-c078-4619-a2ef-327bc6edaa69).\n\nOR\n\n- You can start the face checking round one, this works when they have supports with good mobility or good peel. {[Mercy](hero_0e213bfc-3ca9-49c6-9036-e7f344b752da)[Lucio](hero_b38c5d54-a585-4545-b0b8-4d4b205b3768)[Juno](hero_035c63b7-084c-4abd-9de5-c9a00e9b6a18)[Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54) Etc.} You want to play around cover and behind your tank, just pummeling the enemy tank with M1 attacks. In this case you can go [Ammo Reserves](item_982d53aa-5ef4-493f-93e7-9e374d0ebf34) or if you like to play safer [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6).",
